  "releaseNotes": "Release notes look best on GitHub: https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/releases/tag/v8.5.6\n## Cherry picked commits from\nMultiple new expression functions by @olemartinorg https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1067\nDon't require auth for fetching app languages by @bjosttveit https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1115\nSupport getting page order from navigation groups by @bjosttveit https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1005\nUpdate MimeTypeMap.cs to include audio/x-m4a for .m4a files by @ivarne https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1117\n## Other Changes\nChore/release8.5 cherry-picks by @ivarne in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1126\nFull Changelog: https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/compare/v8.5.5...v8.5.6",
